    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/4/74039.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "And by the way, the rest of the world would love to see us get off the dollar as the currency of the world. They would love to see us fail economically. You almost get the feeling some people that are in Congress, both Senate and the House, would like to see us fail so we can restart and be a third world nation. I don't know why they feel like that better. Maybe next time we could talk about that. But I definitely don't understand why this continues. So what are the complete absolute must-habs for you when it comes to negotiating raising the debt ceiling. What must you see from the Senate Democrats and from Biden before you say yes to raising the debt ceiling?",
